<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14535" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dī-vārĭco</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>,
				ātum, 1, v. a. and
			n.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>, <i>to spread asunder</i>,
				<i>to stretch apart</i> (very rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">taleas super terram,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato R.
					R. 45 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tigna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr.
					10, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hominem in ea statua,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Verr. 2, 4, 40</span></i>
			: divaricatis cruribus, Prud. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφ</span>. 5, 252; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pedibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 22, 11</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Neutr.</i>, <i>to be spread out</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ungulae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 5, 8</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
